  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Echensogha Farmers Multipurpose Cooperative Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to develop EFMCS business and financial management capacities through a series of trainings, to construct concrete-fish ponds, provide training in catfish farming techniques, and establish working capital funds for the purchase of catfish juveniles, feed and other production inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
